    "updated_at": "2025-04-14T18:58:23Z",
    "body": "I see two possibilities for hosting this work in the WHATWG and supporting separate issue tracking:\n\n1. Incubate in a branch of whatwg/html and create a new repo only for issue tracking. I think PRs to merge to this branch would not be possible without notifying whatwg/html watchers.\n2. Incubate in a new repo (fork of whatwg/html or blank) under whatwg.",
